# Vue Components & Views

See `docs/agents/components.md` for full conventions.

- Options API (`export default { name, props, data, methods, … }`)
- User-visible text via `$t()` — keys in `src/language/de/translations.json`
- API calls through `Api*Service`, not raw axios
- Gate actions with `*PermissionService`
- Use Vuetify 2 components and existing layouts (`src/layouts/`)
